OL,5,G0930 Essential Classics
OL,6,     FGeorgia Mann plays the best in
OL,7,     Fclassical music for your morning,
OL,8,     Fwith discoveries and surprises
OL,9,     Frubbing shoulders with familiar
OL,10,     Ffavourites.
OL,11,G1300 Classical Live
OL,12,     FElizabeth Alker brings you
OL,13,     Fexclusive live performances,
OL,14,     Fincluding music by Poulenc,
OL,15,     FVaughan Williams and Niels Gade.
OL,16,G1600 Composer of the Week: Rameau
OL,17,     F4/5. Donald Macleod delves into
OL,18,     FRameau's collaborations with the
OL,19,     Fplaywright Louis de Cahusac,
OL,20,     Fincluding the tragedy Zoroastre
OL,21,     Fwith its masonic themes.
